{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"hechang-e-cbf5f1540a178078ea74","title":"裴楷历侍中中书令光禄开府","accounts":[{"id":"hechang-a-cbf5f1540a178078ea74","label":"裴注·传补叙及晋诸公赞","text":"裴楷历侍中中书令光禄开府","evidence":["hechang-q-9f1f8d485d246b0a7b49"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xunyu-p0058","role":"任官","evidence":["hechang-q-9f1f8d485d246b0a7b49"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["hechang-q-9f1f8d485d246b0a7b49"]},"ordering_evidence":"hechang-q-9f1f8d485d246b0a7b49","order":4847},{"id":"hechang-e-3d906ba5e6e1bf238b68","title":"裴楷王戎同为掾钟会致司马昭司马昭辟楷","accounts":[{"id":"hechang-a-3d906ba5e6e1bf238b68","label":"裴注·传补叙及晋诸公赞","text":"裴楷王戎同为掾钟会致司马昭司马昭辟楷","evidence":["hechang-q-93d19f910e1f3862b6fd"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xunyu-p0058","role":"受辟任官","evidence":["hechang-q-93d19f910e1f3862b6fd"]},{"person":"xunyu-p0059","role":"同任掾","evidence":["hechang-q-93d19f910e1f3862b6fd"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0073","role":"荐举","evidence":["hechang-q-93d19f910e1f3862b6fd"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0045","role":"征辟","evidence":["hechang-q-93d19f910e1f3862b6fd"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"未审定公元年，不从相邻段落推算。","evidence":["hechang-q-93d19f910e1f3862b6fd"]},"ordering_evidence":"hechang-q-93d19f910e1f3862b6fd","order":4849}],"persons":[{"id":"xunyu-p0058","name":"裴楷","evidence":["xunyu-q-p026","hechang-q-9f1f8d485d246b0a7b49","hechang-q-93d19f910e1f3862b6fd","hechang-q-9ea4395441ceb43197c3"],"facts":[{"id":"hechang-f-fc7b9d6933398e406362","text":"字叔则，裴徽之子。","evidence":["hechang-q-9ea4395441ceb43197c3"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"xunyu-m-p026-xunyu-p0058","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xunyu-q-p026"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"hechang-q-93d19f910e1f3862b6fd","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-7511aa5f4df4e3a44fe9","layer":"pei","quote":"楷少与琅邪王戎俱为掾，发名，钟会致之大将军司马文王曰：‘裴楷清通，王戎简要。’文王即辟为掾，进历显位。","attribution":"裴注·传补叙及晋诸公赞","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":382,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-e3d593d747be095d124a","start":154,"end":205},{"id":"hechang-q-9ea4395441ceb43197c3","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-7511aa5f4df4e3a44fe9","layer":"pei","quote":"潜少弟徽，字文季。冀州刺史。有高才远度，善言玄妙。事见荀粲、傅嘏、王弼、管辂诸传。徽长子黎，字伯宗。一名演。游击将军。次康，字仲豫。太子左卫率。次楷，字叔则。侍中、中书令、光禄大夫，开府。次绰，字季舒。黄门侍郎，早卒，追赠长水校尉。康、楷、绰皆为名士，而楷才望最重。《晋诸公赞》曰：“康有弘量；绰以明达为称；楷少与琅邪王戎俱为掾，发名，钟会致之大将军司马文王曰：‘裴楷清通，王戎简要。’文王即辟为掾，进历显位。”谢鲲为《乐广传》，称楷“俊朗有识具，当时独步”。","attribution":"裴注（引书见原文，待主审复核）","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":382,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-e3d593d747be095d124a","start":0,"end":230},{"id":"hechang-q-9f1f8d485d246b0a7b49","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-7511aa5f4df4e3a44fe9","layer":"pei","quote":"次楷，字叔则。侍中、中书令、光禄大夫，开府。","attribution":"裴注·传补叙及晋诸公赞","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":382,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-e3d593d747be095d124a","start":72,"end":94},{"id":"xunyu-q-p026","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-dfbaeb048700cd5bb971","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《荀氏家传》曰：“恽字长倩，俣字叔倩，诜字曼倩；俣子寓，字景伯。”《世语》曰：“寓少与裴楷、王戎、杜默，俱有名京邑。仕晋，位至尚书，名见显著。子羽嗣，位至尚书。”","attribution":"《荀氏家传》《世语》","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":184,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-91315725914c064021bb","start":0,"end":84}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
